Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.18,0:00:03.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.43,0:00:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.55,0:00:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去哪了 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To where? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法逃跑是因为他虚弱不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's running because he's weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱绝不会追随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell will never follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.51,0:00:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给了我我最需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me what I needed most.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给予你同样的回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to do the same for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.99,0:00:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是图妮·贝维尔 记录者 伦敦分会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toni Bevell. Men of Letters, London Chapterhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.70,0:00:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩呢 - 死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Dean? - Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你告诉我名字 地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to give me names and locations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.10,0:00:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.41,0:00:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,去 你 妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw…you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要逼我这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really gonna make me do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,常言说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.08,0:00:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好事都…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good things come to those …
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.89,0:00:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.84,0:00:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再尝试击垮他的身体 而是击垮他的头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop trying to break his body. We break his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.19,0:00:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你并不那么擅长你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're not as good at your job as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.30,0:01:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.26,0:01:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:04.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.90,0:01:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不是好多了吗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't this much more pleasant, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.88,0:01:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 这我可没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to say, I did not see that happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,常言说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.87,0:01:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,异性相吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Opposites attract.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会到那一步的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we'll get there, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.48,0:01:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,再问几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just another couple of questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第12季第2集]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你肯定在夸大吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But surely you exaggerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.43,0:01:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国猎人不可能像你说的那么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}American Hunters can't be as bad as you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:02:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 真就那么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh, yeah, they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.37,0:02:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 英国不是这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, they're not in the U.K.?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.63,0:02:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为我们工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they work for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是工具 只杀 不思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tools. They kill. They don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.87,0:02:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁招募了你和你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who recruited you and your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.47,0:02:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们向谁报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}To whom do you report?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.71,0:02:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会只说一晚的话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not just gonna talk all night, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在监控上没有任何发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't found anything on these surveillance cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就像凭空消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's like they just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 有没有当地的片警\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you? Any of the local beat cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到什么形迹可疑的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}see anybody that shouldn't be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.01,0:02:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里挺偏僻 没几个片警\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty rural. Not a lot of beat cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.85,0:02:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查过了所有旅馆 废弃建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've checked all the motels, abandoned buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.49,0:02:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有萨姆的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.60,0:02:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说不好 去地产中介办公室转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. You know, check… real-estate offices.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看有没有人买下或租了什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if anybody bought a place or rented a place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:02:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人连飞机都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, these people had a freakin' plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:02:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许他们都走正规途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they do things legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.58,0:03:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,明早打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈回来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been kind of weird here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.72,0:03:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with, you know, Mom being back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.21,0:03:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们似乎不知道该如何跟彼此相处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like we don't know how to act around each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.05,0:03:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们就拉拉家常 装作一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we just kind of make this small talk and act normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.26,0:03:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝对不正常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's … it's so not normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I'm … I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.39,0:03:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对你说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … what has she said to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.59,0:03:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That … that … that's the whole point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.51,0:03:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对她说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what have you said to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nothing. I'm …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.55,0:03:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该对她说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to say to her, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切让人太难接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It … it's … it's like it's all just too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.12,0:03:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让她承受不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and…I don't want to overwhelm her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别没必要地把事情复杂化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make things needlessly complicated,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们人类总这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you humans tend to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.73,0:03:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有帮助 多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's helpful. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.99,0:03:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有萨姆的消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any news on Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边…来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so somewhere outsi… here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:03:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在密苏里州奥尔德里奇城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere outside of Aldrich, Missouri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.81,0:04:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡正在那里一点点到处找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is going through it with a fine-toothed comb,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽可能破解了所有的数据库\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've cracked every database I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.64,0:04:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一次人生中没有互联网\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Internet your first time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家连电动打字机都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our house didn't have an electric typewriter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的害怕让我承受不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…are you really afraid of overwhelming me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, look, I am…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}thrilled that you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我高兴得要受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm so damn happy, I-I-I can't even stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.71,0:04:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是需要点时间来跟上时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just gonna take me a second to catch up, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.30,0:04:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, no. Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要多久都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}take … take all the time you need, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.97,0:04:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's … it is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们找到萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we do find Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么面对他\N{\fnArial\fs30}how am I gonna face him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.37,0:05:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄眼恶魔那晚会去找他 都是因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That yellow-eyed thing would never have come for him that night if I…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我引起了这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.73,0:05:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在令人惊讶 虽然你和其他猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just surprising that for all your efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}yours and all the Hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.69,0:05:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这国家依然怪物横行\N{\fnArial\fs30}monsters remain rampant in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.46,0:05:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we just, uh …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能不断努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just keep plugging away, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.74,0:05:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有想过 别误会我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever think … and don't take this the wrong way …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们中有些人可能有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}that some of your soldiers may have been compromised?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.49,0:05:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是被收买了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我不觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-I don't, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.55,0:05:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:05:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.62,0:06:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.39,0:06:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.29,0:06:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该跟你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shouldn't … I shouldn't be talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得承认 沉浸其中时还蛮好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to admit, it was fun while it lasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.15,0:06:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,用药剂和强大的咒语制造了一个幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}An hallucination created by potion and powerful spell work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.81,0:06:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得爽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…was it good for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 我不能再重复那个咒语了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly, I can't do the spell again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.55,0:06:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的大脑会化成水 我们不希望那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brain would liquify, which we don't want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时还不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.77,0:06:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:06:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能采取不那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to resort to less…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,愉快的办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}pleasant methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,强化审讯并不是我工作的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enhanced interrogation was never part of my job description.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as it turns out…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我学得很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I'm a quick study.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.97,0:07:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡得好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Hey, how'd you sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.36,0:07:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了一整晚的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had dreams all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.09,0:07:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好梦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是些我已经忘记的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff I'd forgotten about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸做的很逗的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny stuff your dad did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个好爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a great father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 查到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能找到萨姆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I may have found Sam's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一间农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.35,0:08:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去是空的 但是两周前租了出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears empty, but it was rented two weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,租给了一个操英国口音的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a woman with an English accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看里面了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have a look inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有很强大的符文保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's … it's powerfully warded.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.92,0:08:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很强大的符文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powerfully warded?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.85,0:08:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, see, buddy, that …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.85,0:08:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是大标题啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was your headline right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在说同一话题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we still discussing the same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.02,0:08:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把地址发给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll text you the address.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.25,0:08:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, got it. I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去拿衣服 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get my coat. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.91,0:08:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我自己去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't I take this one solo, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.08,0:08:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不知道里面的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just … we don't know what we're walking into here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.31,0:08:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是当然的 我们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never know. We're Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:09:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我要是担心着你 就不能好好工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I-I can't do my job if I'm worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.57,0:09:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't have to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.91,0:09:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.86,0:09:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 好的 谈话愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? All right, good talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.33,0:09:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 萨姆 我们重新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Sam. Let's start again, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.52,0:09:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.73,0:09:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经清空了安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've cleared my calendar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.93,0:09:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.08,0:09:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人的名字和住址\N{\fnArial\fs30}names and locations of every Hunter…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.93,0:09:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有地堡里\N{\fnArial\fs30}the passcodes to each and every.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录者数据库的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of Letters database held in the bunker,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then … oh, yes …
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈你和恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's do discuss your relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the demon Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.30,0:09:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真不乖 图妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a bad girl, Toni.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've come to fetch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.58,0:09:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓了萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:09:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要松口了 别来打扰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's close to breaking. Just leave me be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你违背了命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disobeyed orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 你得知道 你的瓦特女士 死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and you should know, your Ms. Watt … quite dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特和他的朋友干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Courtesy of Dean Winchester and friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我去了最好的寄宿学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent me to the grandest boarding schools,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我调皮 逃走去追求艺术了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was a wee imp and ran away for a life in the arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我成了明星 我妈妈才肯跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother didn't speak to me until I became a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.18,0:10:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}A star?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.75,0:10:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有关注皇家芭蕾舞团吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, do you follow the Royal Ballet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.13,0:10:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是皇家芭蕾舞团\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Royal Ballet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.17,0:10:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我联想到了我自己的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it reminds me a lot of my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是离开学校去钢厂工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left school to work in a steel mill.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.05,0:10:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路升职 现在 我是六家钢厂的主人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rose up through the ranks, and now I own half a dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.53,0:10:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来点酒吗 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}More wine, madam?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就像个疖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're like a boil that keeps coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挑掉多少次都会再长出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter how many times I have it lanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.14,0:11:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.33,0:11:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的晚餐男伴多金 单身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dinner date is loaded, single,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能还有健康问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}and possibly in delicate health.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.65,0:11:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 就是想吐槽一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What of it? - Well, just a stab,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.81,0:11:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你或许不希望我揭露 他的女伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you probably don't want me to reveal that his snookums.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.52,0:11:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是300岁的老女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}is 300 years old and a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.43,0:11:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,费格斯 那人把我当女王对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fergus, the man treats me like a queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.00,0:11:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我抛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my chance to leave behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物 恶魔和潮湿藏身处的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}monsters and demons and moldy hideouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢给我搞砸 我让你兜着走\N{\fnArial\fs30}So help me, if you muck this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.28,0:11:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不敢 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I wouldn't dream of it, Mummy…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你帮我个小忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you do me one tiny favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我对付路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me with Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.23,0:11:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要算笔账\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a score to settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.90,0:11:51.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（文斯·文森特 世界巡演）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.41,0:12:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为文斯·文森特和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear it for Vince Vincente.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.27,0:12:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他乐队成员鼓掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the rest of the band!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.31,0:12:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次见 晚安 克利夫兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you the next time around. Good night, Cleveland!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.70,0:12:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 克利夫兰 我们爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Cleveland! We love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,文尼 我们今晚去镇上 一起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Vinny, we're hitting the town tonight. Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.14,0:12:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看克利夫兰的美景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check out the wonders of Cleveland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 不了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, um… I'm good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.84,0:12:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 汤米 汤米 来啊 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tommy, Tommy, come on! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.43,0:12:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头来找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'll catch up with you guys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.12,0:12:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得享受你的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to start living your life, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表演 喝酒 睡觉 表演 喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You perform, you drink, you sleep, perform, drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.24,0:12:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.69,0:12:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯 珍都死了好多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince, it's been years since Jen died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.78,0:13:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想说 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I mean, brother, is,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.39,0:13:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也不会希望你就这么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't you think she'd want more for you than just …
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.67,0:13:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去吧 汤米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here, Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看克利夫兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go see Cleveland.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我听了你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I let you talk me into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.44,0:13:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能听我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to do what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.39,0:14:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.40,0:14:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们直奔了地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}They targeted the bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然对你和萨姆非常了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}They obviously know a lot about you and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道你会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.87,0:14:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们绝料不到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the last person they'd expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.07,0:14:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你原来很厉害 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were good at this, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.53,0:14:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.15,0:14:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, Hunters…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管多厉害 最终结果都是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter how good they are, they all end up the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死后 爸爸变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know when you died, it changed Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一心要查清真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he was Hell-bent on finding out what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.37,0:14:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人的生活占据了他的全部\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hunter life, it just took him over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.84,0:14:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I was the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但萨姆 他不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Sammy … Sammy, he was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.66,0:14:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想脱离\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.82,0:14:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去上了学 去了斯坦福\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went to school. He went to Stanford.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:14:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆曾有机会脱离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam had a chance to get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他却回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he came back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸失踪后 萨姆和我去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Dad disappeared, Sam and I looked around,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.47,0:15:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我们明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}and something became very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.76,0:15:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这世上 我们唯一拥有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the only thing we had in this world … the only thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}aside from this car …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}was each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,前台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, front desk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.91,0:16:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.39,0:16:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.10,0:17:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.15,0:17:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.59,0:17:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.11,0:17:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.31,0:17:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to say I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.51,0:17:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,服下那些药片太自私了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swallowing those pills was selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年我一直想着当初我是怎么对你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had to live all these years knowing how I treated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.70,0:17:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时 抛下你似乎很公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the time, leaving you seemed fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.23,0:17:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你曾那么多次抛下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you left me so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I want is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.94,0:17:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是可以的 文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can happen, Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.47,0:17:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.02,0:17:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.33,0:18:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.50,0:18:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are real?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.63,0:18:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真实而且强大 文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real and very powerful, Vince.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.70,0:18:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以带走你的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take away your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring you peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.53,0:18:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只需要做一件很简单的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only have to do one easy thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.86,0:18:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿邀请我进来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you invite me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.99,0:18:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the bloody hold-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话薄里就他一个撒旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one and only Satan in the phonebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是巫术 不是谷歌地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's witchcraft, not Google Maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般来说 我都有一绺头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}And normally I'd have a piece of hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是一件随身物品来锁定位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a belonging to lock on to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.39,0:18:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你连他的样子都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know what he looks like!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有股气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has an aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.21,0:18:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,极致的邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supreme evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定那个啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock on to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:18:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,事事都得我来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have to do everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.12,0:19:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我又在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I'm once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个潮湿的洞里找魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}down some dank hole seeking the devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.12,0:19:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候是个头啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}When does it end?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.09,0:19:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我退休去了波卡拉顿的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's exactly why I'm retiring to Boca Raton.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.77,0:19:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟本一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,会做很棒的燕麦粥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who makes oatmeal look fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成功 稳定 而且我能比他命长\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's successful, stable, and I'll outlive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.66,0:19:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我告诉你地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I'll give you the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.39,0:19:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 别急\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想在我们出击前知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to know who we're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要对付谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们」是指温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}By "we, " I presume you mean the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.84,0:19:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们的天使宝宝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and their pet angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.95,0:19:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得把路西法关回笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to put Lucifer back in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.68,0:19:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你是唯一做得到的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one that can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,早该猜到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've known.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 费格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Fergus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要再卷入那些破事里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll not be involved in that nonsense again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.83,0:20:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我该把你的真面目告诉本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I should tell Ben about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我该杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe just kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.27,0:20:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 波卡没戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, it's bye-bye, Boca.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.91,0:20:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个恶毒的蛇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a hateful snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.98,0:20:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 路西法在皮囊里时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case, Lucifer can't be sent back to the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能被关回笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}while he's in a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们准备好了他就不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not by the time we're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.83,0:20:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提到的符文都在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's all this warding you mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.92,0:21:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐形了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cloaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.32,0:21:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.19,0:21:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把你妈也带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.25,0:21:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定里面有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure there's anyone inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,中介说租约是远程完成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The agent said the lease was handled long distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有人给房子加了符文\N{\fnArial\fs30}but someone warded the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.08,0:21:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去靠近看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go have a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.86,0:21:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以不让我开车 迪恩 不能不让我猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can keep me from driving, Dean. Not from hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被符文挡在外面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm locked out by the warding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.87,0:21:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要人陪陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.65,0:21:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.11,0:21:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 都中午了 让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, it's noon. Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.29,0:22:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.65,0:22:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿得这么正式去彩排啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty dressed up for rehearsal, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.69,0:22:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,彩排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rehearsal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.19,0:22:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.69,0:22:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我没法去彩排了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I just can't make it to rehearsal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有别的事要做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you got better plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.59,0:22:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,文斯 我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.80,0:22:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.50,0:22:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.73,0:22:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, stop screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.94,0:22:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 我有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I had plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.09,0:23:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.88,0:23:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Screw yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.55,0:24:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.32,0:24:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一样很高兴见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm as happy to see him as you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.68,0:24:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 虽然你可以承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause while you may be able to withstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.61,0:24:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个个关节地扭断你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}my snapping apart your body joint by joint,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看着迪恩遭受这折磨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}can you watch it happen to Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.45,0:24:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉我你在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me you'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.36,0:24:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我的家具上下来 蹭房的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off my furniture, squatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.90,0:24:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.39,0:24:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮囊是文斯·文森特 二流明星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wearing Vince Vincente, second-tier star.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.73,0:24:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为比伯更符合你的气质呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've thought Bieber was more your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.60,0:24:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要么是疯了 要么是傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're either mad or dim.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.81,0:24:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.43,0:24:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么想要统治一帮鱼龙混杂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why in Hell would you want to rule over a motley,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.29,0:24:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}witless crew of demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.09,0:25:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝又去休假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's on sabbatical again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.42,0:25:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以重夺天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could reclaim Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.22,0:25:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那块地产才值得统治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's real estate that's worth ruling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.86,0:25:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以来掌管分支办事处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle the branch office.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.91,0:25:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.63,0:25:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以抬抬手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could raise my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.28,0:25:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}smite you into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.26,0:25:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.22,0:25:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.92,0:25:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.35,0:25:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.93,0:25:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.43,0:25:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.69,0:25:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈的麻痹咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mummy's little paralyzing spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.30,0:25:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 很奏效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.39,0:25:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.31,0:25:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会很久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.52,0:25:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy water?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.89,0:25:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.47,0:25:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh, ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.35,0:25:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别无聊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bore me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.58,0:26:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 是上等硫酸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, it'its top-shelf sulfuric acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.83,0:26:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你是没有伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harmless to you, I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.59,0:26:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对你的皮囊 可就伤害大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but to your vessel, not so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.04,0:26:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Passcodes, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.54,0:26:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.89,0:26:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么想补充的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything to add?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.17,0:26:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我就是来喝杯茶 挨顿打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I just came by for some tea and a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.65,0:26:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.21,0:26:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你或许想聊聊你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I thought you might be on for a little chat about your mate,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.45,0:26:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,本杰明·拉菲特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benjamin Lafitte.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.96,0:26:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.00,0:26:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喊他本尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called him Benny.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.99,0:26:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你从炼狱放出来的吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the vampire whom you released from Purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.04,0:26:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还跟他成了朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and befriended.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.99,0:27:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.77,0:27:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.17,0:27:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国人最有耐心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the English are nothing if not patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.02,0:27:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.00,0:27:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的灵质 把它送回笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}His essence, send it back to the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.62,0:27:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.69,0:27:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.58,0:27:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.15,0:27:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.99,0:27:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.61,0:27:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.00,0:28:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力不乖哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad, bad Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.07,0:28:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.03,0:28:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把那孩子宠坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spoil that boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.38,0:28:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.07,0:28:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.05,0:28:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure that I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.38,0:28:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 我会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.64,0:29:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会告诉你一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you everything, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.05,0:29:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 生气辣妹是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}First off, who's Angry Spice?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.96,0:29:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}She, uh … she's … she's Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.41,0:29:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国的记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, British Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.00,0:29:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那玩意 搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a thing? What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.11,0:29:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是一队的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't we supposed to be on the same team?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.63,0:29:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.09,0:29:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 回顾一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen. So, to recap …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.29,0:29:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们住在记录者的地堡里\N{\fnArial\fs30}you live in the Men of Letters bunker,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.76,0:29:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,周围是世上最大的神秘知识收藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}awash in the world's greatest collection of occult knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.32,0:29:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们却什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet you know "Nothing."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.33,0:29:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.67,0:29:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是浪费\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.81,0:29:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两只猿猴似乎没读过一本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems you apes have never read a single book.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.04,0:29:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录者一直以智力超群闻名\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Men of Letters has a long tradition of intellectual excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.22,0:29:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伦敦 我们对最晦涩的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}In London, we've undertaken exhaustive studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.33,0:29:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也进行过详尽研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}of even the most arcane topics.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.83,0:29:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 人体痛感最强烈的部位\N{\fnArial\fs30}For example, parts of the body most sensitive to intense pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.47,0:30:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳鼓膜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ear drum.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.94,0:30:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decaying tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.49,0:30:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,腰带下面 不用说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Below the belt, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.11,0:30:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我最喜欢的 眼皮下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my favorite … under the eyelid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.84,0:30:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 人是可以疼死的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know it's possible to die from pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.51,0:30:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away from my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.84,0:30:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.76,0:30:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.47,0:30:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.47,0:30:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.52,0:30:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.17,0:31:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.47,0:31:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.64,0:31:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,中止咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill the spell now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.88,0:31:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.85,0:31:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,打我 你妈妈就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot me, and your mother has no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.44,0:31:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.27,0:32:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.22,0:32:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.44,0:32:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她用的是中国的头脑控制技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was using a Chinese mind-control technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.03,0:32:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦失去意识就做不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to do when you're unconscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.94,0:32:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来本猿猴还是读过一两本书的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out this ape did read a book or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.86,0:32:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well played.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.73,0:32:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得知的情况大体没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}What yat were told is basically true.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.21,0:32:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很想了解你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were keen on knowing about the two of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.31,0:32:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为美国的\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing as you seem to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.90,0:32:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录者分部关闭后\N{\fnArial\fs30}partially carrying on the Men of Letters' work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.60,0:32:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们似乎部分继承了他们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}now that the American chapter is defunct.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.77,0:32:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你派你的攻击犬是来跟我们打招呼的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you sic your attack dog on us to what, say hi?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.32,0:32:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们组织里有些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, part of our group.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.13,0:32:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,怀疑你们美国猎人有渎职行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}suspect some kind of malfeasance amongst you American Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.70,0:32:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 贝维尔夫人太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No argument … Lady Bevell went too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.13,0:32:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深表歉意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deeply apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.20,0:32:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会在伦敦受到惩戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll face consequences in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.29,0:33:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 你出去走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what, why don't you take a walk,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.63,0:33:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她此时此地就受到惩戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she can face those consequences right here and now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.62,0:33:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.40,0:33:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会处理她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.90,0:33:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来递出橄榄枝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm here to extend an olive branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.64,0:33:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想跟你们合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.33,0:33:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你个问题 米克吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you a question, uh, Mick is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.68,0:33:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要相信你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would we believe any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.90,0:33:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位 如果我不是真心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lads…if I wasn't sincere,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.70,0:33:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我想伤害你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I meant you harm,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.95,0:33:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有十几种办法可以进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a dozen ways I could've come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.87,0:33:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,劫持你们所有人 而不是赤手空拳地进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and taken you all prisoner instead of being unarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.14,0:33:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别说 我去掉了小屋的符文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention I powered down all the wardings in this shack.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.17,0:33:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们的攻击犬进得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so your attack dog could come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.20,0:33:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以轻松干掉我 汗都不会流\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reckon you could finish me off without breaking a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.95,0:33:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.79,0:33:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不流汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't sweat under any circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.27,0:33:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}My number.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.53,0:34:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不着急 冷静下来 好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your time, cool down, and just think it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.31,0:34:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怕失去什么呢 除了你们最糟的噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what have you got to lose, except your worst nightmares?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.00,0:34:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好吃了 谢谢 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that was fantastic. Thank you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.01,0:34:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是点了外卖菜单上的几道菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I did was point at some stuff on a take-out menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.21,0:34:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本想做饭 但我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've cooked, but I, uh…don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.83,0:34:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.82,0:34:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的肉卷很好吃啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your meat loaf was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.41,0:34:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小猪扭扭买来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came from the Piggly Wiggly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.00,0:34:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打破你的幻想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to burst your bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.91,0:34:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还喜欢派吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you still like pie?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.22,0:34:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.94,0:34:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.37,0:34:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总看着我 好像我要爆炸似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep looking at me like I'm going to explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.26,0:34:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.55,0:35:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what do we think?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.78,0:35:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要相信英国佬那套「我们做朋友吧」的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we buying that Brit's whole "let's be friends" routine?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.73,0:35:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不可能 - 不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No way. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.12,0:35:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能吃得更快点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you eat that any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.01,0:35:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.10,0:35:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该打给互联网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we should call the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.06,0:35:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量了解一下这些人的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}and find out as much as we can about these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.35,0:35:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说对了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I say that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.26,0:35:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So close.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.95,0:35:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.41,0:35:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want any?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.93,0:35:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Uh, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.18,0:35:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 罗威娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got to say, Rowena,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.04,0:35:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took one look at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.73,0:36:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就想再折断一次你讨厌的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all I wanted was to snap your miserable neck again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.85,0:36:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次让你恢复不过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And keep it snapped this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.58,0:36:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我决定不那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think I've decided against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.71,0:36:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会后悔的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't regret it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.74,0:36:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再搅和这些事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done with all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.14,0:36:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会躲得远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay far, far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.60,0:36:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去我的网球俱乐部里跟共和党人一起喝马丁尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}sipping martinis with republicans at my tennis club.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.05,0:36:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're missing my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.96,0:36:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样天资聪明的女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}A witch as gifted as yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.22,0:36:34.92,Title,0,0,0,0,,此外 还有《诅咒之书》\N{\fnArial\fs30}with access to the Book of the Damned to boot,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.11,0:36:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为囚徒对我更有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}would be much more valuable as a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.22,0:36:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.56,0:36:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那句话怎么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that saying go?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.34,0:36:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友要亲近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm, friends close…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.98,0:36:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人要更近\N{\fnArial\fs30}…enemies closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.39,0:36:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.98,0:36:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.46,0:37:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.26,0:37:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 希望没吵醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I hope I didn't wake you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.54,0:37:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给你端这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I, uh…wanted to bring you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.74,0:37:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.67,0:37:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你喝不喝茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you drink tea, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.42,0:37:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喝 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.69,0:37:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, and I wanted to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.38,0:37:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you ever want to talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.28,0:37:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解回到人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it's like to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.25,0:37:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得自己格格不入的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not feel like you really fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.55,0:37:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要补上好多关于你们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have so much about you boys to catch up on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.84,0:37:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.00,0:37:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一颗牙 第一次暗恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, first tooth, first crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.26,0:37:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.50,0:37:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有好多空白要填补\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have a lot of blanks to fill in.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.12,0:37:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.11,0:38:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.03,0:38:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自己写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}His writing, his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.01,0:38:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我填补了不少空白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helped me fill in some blanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.53,0:38:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,回答了一些我原本没想到过的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}answer some questions I didn't know I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.21,0:38:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,也算是让他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, you know, it … it … it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.13,0:38:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续留在我们身边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeps him with us, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.15,0:38:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.72,0:38:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.41,0:38:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩说你脱离了猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean said you got out of hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.03,0:38:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.71,0:38:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.70,0:38:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.92,0:38:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们家猎魔 我们就做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family hunts, you know? It's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.71,0:38:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.57,0:38:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.25,0:38:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,光是\N{\fnArial\fs30}just, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.95,0:39:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}having you here…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.59,0:39:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就填补了最大的空白\N{\fnArial\fs30}fills in the biggest blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.44,0:39:48.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（来复枪专家）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.48,0:40:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会上飞机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not get on that plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.28,0:40:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.94,0:40:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务是找到美国猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission was to identify American Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.95,0:40:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,取得他们的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gain their trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.03,0:40:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是总部的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the home office wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.58,0:40:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是礼 不是兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, not vinegar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.65,0:40:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有份案卷 我这才刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a dossier, and I am just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.40,0:40:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也做成了不少事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've also had their fair share of successes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.85,0:40:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们的目标是终结这里的超自然威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If our goal is to end the supernatural threat here,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.79,0:40:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得摧毁一切障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to destroy every obstacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.40,0:40:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟 这些美国猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters, these American Hunters,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.10,0:40:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不比他们控制不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're no better than the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.53,0:40:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些怪物强到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}they fail to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.80,0:40:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们该被铲除\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need to be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.30,0:40:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.27,0:41:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果走到那一步 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If push comes to shove, your ladyship,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.51,0:41:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做好了那个准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm prepared for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.70,0:41:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会下狠手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get your hands dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.04,0:41:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种事可以留给凯奇先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we have Mr. Ketch for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.04,0:41:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会叫他来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll send for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.74,0:41:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经叫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already have.
